3. Create pipelines/enrichment/src/main/resources/application.conf with exactly the content in the hocon fence below (poll interval, kafka group, bronze, spark, opencode; no feeds section).
```hocon
newspipe {
  poll-interval-seconds = 300
  kafka {
    bootstrap-servers = "localhost:9092"
    raw-topic = "raw_rss"
    group-id = "enrichment-group"
  }
  bronze {
    path = "s3a://lakehouse/bronze/news"
  }
  spark {
    master = "local[*]"
  }
  opencode {
    model = "opencode/muse-spark-1.3-contributor-free"
    timeout-seconds = 120
  }
}
```
Prove: `grep -n 'group-id' pipelines/enrichment/src/main/resources/application.conf` prints the group line.
